<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Dear {{{Case.Consultants_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
The reference for your Qantas Fare Reassessment made via Qantas Agency Connect is:<br />
{{{Case.CaseNumber}}}<br />
<br />
We are unable to action your request for the following reason:</p>

<ul>
	<li>The PNR Reference/Ticket number is incorrect</li>
	<li>The flights held in the PNR do not match your request</li>
	<li>The booking classes held do not match your request</li>
	<li>The flights are not booked from Origin to Destination</li>
	<li>The ticket number has not been provided</li>
	<li>The ticket number provided is expired and/or not valid</li>
	<li>Flight application failure. The carrier/s {{{Case.PNR_number__c}}} is/are not permitted</li>
	<li>The route map application does not permit the itinerary</li>
	<li>The private fare code has not been provided</li>
	<li>The &nbsp;Travel Manager Change (TMC) authorisation has not been provided or is not valid</li>
	<li>The itinerary contains over 16 flights segments including ARNKS</li>
	<li>QAC does not quote other airline End on End fares</li>
	<li>The requested fare does not permit validation to Qantas (081)</li>
	<li>The itinerary must contain a QF flight number</li>
	<li>Only one fare quote per request is permitted.</li>
	<li>Your request is not for a reassessment.</li>
</ul>

<p>Please submit a new request which meets our requirements.<br />
<br />
